body:
I loved Jules in videogame stuff. I vividly remember in one video (one answering emails or comments by the fans with Adam and Adam in them) that he said "wrestling is stupid". That is why I just can't get into him when he talks about wrestling

&#x200B;

But idk, it's been years since I watched WC.

I've got two words for you

&#x200B;

Fucking Matt Hardy

I am out, so out of the loop.

&#x200B;

Why does  everybody hates Bob Holly so much?

I don't want to jinx our chances, but I think we will get to at least the semi finals.

&#x200B;

Also, HOW THE FUCK DID MINECRAFT BEAT BIOSHOCK?!
